me": "Screen2.png", "id": "377912957158275", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974878_377912963824941_6368050802368167649_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=no125sekM10Q7kNvwFjp7Yk&_nc_oc=Adn60_9kwtrpuKLjVZeOmfuLCtAY0NGEHEttIR1YdP3FFh-GqjbwjNy2cnfUD7gWkHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx_20NTu1ytk8JW3UXlys9IEq3-JLgT7zz-wJe-IzUpGQ&oe=69B40077"}, "display_name": "Yue's VR-FPV-Sim", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This an easy way to experience FPV drone-flights in virtual reality with Meta Quest.\n\nFlying FPV is not easy and especially for beginners very challenging. \nIt's save to start in a simulator, before crashing hundreds of dollars of equipment in to the ground.\nFly drones with or without FPV-Goggles in \"Yue's VR-FPV-Sim\".\n\nStart with the guided tutorial and learn all about the gameplay and how to control drones in \"acro-mode\"!\n\n\nTotal of 9 Maps\n\n\u2022 \"Industrial\" 1, 2 & 3\n\u2022 \"Secret Testtrack\" with a driving car\n\u2022 \"Skilift\" with a moving seatlift\n\u2022 \"Hangar\" with a private-jet inside\n\u2022 \"Super Market\" \n\u2022 \"Parking Garage\"\n\u2022 \"Mountain\"             \n                    \n                            \nSimulation Properties\n\n\u2022 Rigidbody Physics, parameters configurable\n\u2022 PID regulated simulation, parameters configurable\n\u2022 Hovereffect\n\n\nGameplay Properties\n\n\u2022 Compatible with a gamepad\n\u2022 Seated or roomscale  \n\u2022 Acrade Mode mini-game", "short_description": "This an easy way to experience FPV and Drone Flights in Virtual Reality with Oculus Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yue-beifong.jimdosite.com/privacy-policy-vr-fpv-sim/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "YueBeifong", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yue-beifong.jimdosite.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "con